{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-avant-garde-residences","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"avant-garde-residences-skyline-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","about":"Avant Garde Residences is a residential complex consisting of 24 floors, located in the Jumeirah Village Circle area. There are apartments with 1-2 bedrooms.The exterior of the building is characterized by modern architecture and elegant design. Thanks to the panoramic windows and balconies, the interiors are flooded with natural light, which creates a cozy atmosphere. The kitchens are fully equipped with modern household appliances of European brands.At the entrance to the building, residents are greeted by a warm and cozy lobby. Shared workplaces provide residents with alternative areas for comfortable work from home.The Avant Garde Residences complex offers a wide range of leisure facilities, including an infinity pool, a rooftop garden, barbecue areas, landscaped gardens, children's play areas, indoor and outdoor sports facilities, a multifunctional hall and a game room.The hotel is located in the Jimeih Village Circle area, from where residents can easily reach amenities such as the Nesto Hypermarket and VIVA Supermarket, as well as various restaurants within walking distance. In addition, Dubai Miracle Garden, Dubai Marina, Palm Jumeirah and the Jumeirah Golf Estates Golf Clubs are within 15-20 minutes' drive, offering residents a variety of leisure activities.","price":686000,"title":"Avant Garde Residences","bitrix":{"id":871,"pf_id":"are.2.13385","source":null,"project_id":"Avant Garde Residences","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Avant Garde Residences","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Skyline","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Circle"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/774/images/2024/01/23/340x252/QRyxnlUHbLV3t67VVpOIgOqbaYLc8rp0FngtKA4c.webp","464x312":"